# Co-op GROUND-EDGE wall: an INVISIBLE 100 m long, 20 m tall static box just inside the 600 m
# ground plane's rim. No Render component - nothing should be able to see the world's edge.
#
# Unlike barrier.pre (Layer Barrier vs Player alone, so waves walk through it), this one leaves the
# layer at Default and so blocks EVERYONE, exactly like rock.pre. It exists because waves spawn in
# the open band BETWEEN the barrier and the ground edge: crowd pressure there used to shove bodies
# off the rim, and a unit de-selected mid-fall keeps a disabled body, so it hung under the map.
# Long axis = X; the Game layer rotates the E/W sides 90°. Spawn y = 10 (collider half height).
Prefab gameEdgeWall
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 50 10 0.5
